@Gateway.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5175
@LocationKey = dev-local-location-key

### Health (auth + DB + POS ping — 503 until LocalSecrets:pilot-api-key is set)
GET {{Gateway.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Authorization: Bearer {{LocationKey}}

### Menu (hits Pilot — needs a real API key in user secrets)
GET {{Gateway.Api_HostAddress}}/menu
Authorization: Bearer {{LocationKey}}

### Inject a pickup order
POST {{Gateway.Api_HostAddress}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{LocationKey}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "order_ref": "OH-LOCAL-001",
  "display_id": "A1",
  "source_channel": "test",
  "location_id": "local-dev",
  "fulfillment_type": "pickup",
  "placed_at": "2026-08-20T12:00:00Z",
  "items": [
    {
      "external_product_id": "dev-plu-1",
      "name": "Test burger",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unit_price_cents": 8500,
      "total_price_cents": 8500,
      "modifiers": []
    }
  ],
  "subtotal_cents": 8500,
  "tax_cents": 0,
  "delivery_fee_cents": 0,
  "tip_cents": 0,
  "total_cents": 8500,
  "currency": "ZAR",
  "payment": {
    "prepaid": true
  }
}
